3. Distillation teachers (reference only, not redistributed)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
During training, molecule is distilled from open-source teacher models
(0.5B–1.5B) using their generated text and soft labels. Teacher weights are
NOT shipped with this repository. Teacher models and their licenses:

  - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct / Qwen2.5-Math-0.5B / Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B /
    Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct  — Apache-2.0 (Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud)
  - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-0.5B — MIT (DeepSeek-AI)

